Petition
Member Ballot:
Cheyenne Little Theatre Players-Atlas
On April9,2015 theboard of directors of the Cheyenne Little Theatre Players approved an amendment
to the bylaws of the corporation, enabling it to apply for a club liquor license.This license will allow
CLTP to purchase liquor, beer and wine at wholesale prices andresale to the CLTPticket holders at the
Historic Atlas Theatre.In order to obtain this license, it is necessary to have approval of the board’s
action by a majority of the shareholders(season ticket holders)of CLTP.If you approve of the board’s
action, please sign below, and print your name and address in the lines following your signature.
Iapproveof the CL TP Board's action as stated above.
Signature:_
Name:
Address:
Return this ballot by APRIL 30, 2015
In the enclosed envelope
OR to the CLTPbox office at Mary Godfrey Theatre at 2706 E.Pershing Blvd, Cheyenne
