```text
CHEYENNE LITTLE THEATRE PLAYERS, INC.
BYLAWS
Amended April2015
Article 1-NAME
The name of this corporation shallbe The Cheyenne Little Theatre Players, Inc.; here after referred to asthe
Corporation.
ARTICLEII-PLACE OF BUSINESS
The principal place of business of the Corporation shallbe in the City of Cheyenne, Laramie County, Wyoming.
ARTICLEIII-PURPOSE
and its extended community.The Corporation is committed to:
providing educational opportunities and growth experiences in theatre and theatre crafts;
(日
increasing community awareness and appreciation of the pre forming arts;
C)
providing the opportunity and the environment for the production and presentation of theatrical
works,
D)
providinga forum forthe development of creative works inthe area of theatre and the performing
arts;
E)
serving as a viable resource for community/economic development;
F)
providing an enjoyable experience to its constituents; and
G)
establishing a sense of pride and legacy forfuture generation of Cheyenne.
The Board of Directors shall be responsible for determining the goals, policies, and activities to carry outthe
purpose of the Corporation.
1
```

