### Page 11 of 29 (scanned page: machine OCR, may contain errors)

```text
SubsectionA: Each vicepresident shall establish sub-committees asrequired andassign sub-
committee chairpersons as necessary.
SubsectionB: Sub Committees maybe comprised of any configuration of participants selected by the
Chairperson to fulfill the needs of the Corporation.
Section3.Executive Committee; The President, Vice President for Finance/Treasurer, Vice President for
Administration/Secretary, Vice President for Programming, Vice President for Fund Development, andthe
Immediate Past President shall constitute the Executive Committee of the Board of Directors.Themanaging&
Artistic Director of the Corporations hall serve as an ex-officio member of this committee.
Section4.Terms.Members of the Board of Directors shall serve for a three-year term or until their successors
member maybe re-electedonly aftera one-year absence from the Board of Directors.An exception to this
rules hall be if a Board Member is elected as an officer in the last year of their second three-yearterm.Inthis
instance, the Board Member'sterm, ifre-elected, would be extended one year so that they could serve a full
two-year term as an officer.The nominee for the office of President will be chosen from members of the
Boardwho are currently or have in the past held theposition of Vice President, and must have atleast two
serve one more year as the Immediate Past President and voting member of the Board of Directors.If theend
of the President's term coincides with the end of their second three-year term as a Board Member, the Board
member term will be extended one more year so that he/she can serve a one year additional term as
Immediate Past President.Two consecutive years shall be the initial term a Director can hold the office of Vice
President.After such a consecutive two-yearterm, a Director maybe re-elected to the office of a Vice
President fora second two-yearterm.Two consecutive years shall be the maximum term a Director mayhold
the office of President.Upon the expiration of his orherterm as President, the Board Member may not be
elected as Vice President until atleast one year has passed.
Section5.Mannerof Selection.The President and Vice President s will be elected at the regular Board of
Directors'meeting in June.
3
```

