Section5.The Vice President for the Administration/Secretary has the responsibility to: A)fulfillall
responsibilities of the President in the absence thereof; B)serve on the Executive Committee; C)chairthe
Administration Committee, the responsibilities of which include:1)facilitating nominations of Board Officers
and newboard members;2)policies and procedures;3)longrange planning; 4)Managing Director review;
and5)legalissues.The Vice President of the Administration Committee shall be responsible to:1)appointa
member of this committee to record attendance and all proceedings in the minutes of the Board of Directors;
2)supervise the procedures whichensure continuity and consistency in the record keeping in all committees;
3)maintain files on all bylaws, policies procedures andplans andsee that they are available at all the meetings
of Board of Directors and the Executive Committee;4)maintaina complete history of the Corporation;5)
minutes of the Administration meetings.
Section6.The Vice President for Programming has the responsibility to: A)fulfillall responsibilities for the
Presidentin theabsence thereof; B)serveonthe Executive Committee; C)chair the Programming
Committee, the responsibilities of which include:1) productions;2)playreading;3)melodrama;4)Theatre
Education and5)special projects.The Vice President of the Programming Committee or their design ee shall:
1) attend all Programming and Melodrama and Theatre Education Sub-Committee meetings; and 2)record
attendance and all proceedings in the minutesof the Programming Standing Committee meetings.
Section7.The Vice President for Fund Development has the responsibility to: A)fulfill all responsibilities of
the President in the absence thereof; B)serve on the Executive Committee, C)chair the Fund Development
Committee, the responsibilities of which include:1) support the financial objectives of CL TP andplanning
activities as established tofulfill the financial needs andgoals of CLTP;2)assist the Managing Director and/or
help monitor that budget and 4)record all attendance and proceedings of the Fund Development
Committee meetings.
