special meeting.
Section4.Quorum.One over have of the members of the Board of Directors shall constitute a quorum for the
transaction of business.
ARTICLEVII-CORPORATE FISCAL YEAR
The fiscal year of the Corporations hall commence on the first day of July of each year and end onthe3othday
of June each year.
