ARTICLEIX-PARLIAMENTARY AUTHORITY
Roberts Rules of Order, Newly Revised, will govern the meetings of the Corporation in all cases in which it is
not inconsistent with these bylaws.
ARTICLEX-AMENDMENTS
These bylaws maybe amended bya two-thirdsvote of the full Board of Directors at any meeting, provided
that all proposed amendments have been presented in writing to all membersof the Board of Directors prior
to the meeting.
