Cheyenne Little Theatre Players Events at The Atlas Theatre2014-2015
July10-August3rd: The Old Fashioned Melodrama is CL TP'slargest
eventbyfar.Forover57years we have been providing family friendly
western themed entertainment in Cheyenne, with two shows a night
event.
September2oth: Cheyenne Zombie fest, one of the largest downtown
be!People of all ages who enjoy the popular zombie craze, orjust
aficionados of Halloween kookiness flock to downtown for bands, food
and fun for all. We have provided malt beverages for this event each
yearboth on the plaza and in the Atlas Theatre.
October31st-November1st: The Rocky Horror PictureS how brings the
Time Warp to the Atlas Theatre every Halloween.Malt beverages are
served at this event.
November 14th-16th: Moonlight and Magnolias, the first staged reading
of the season. No alcohol was provided at this event.
January23rd-25th: Comic Strip Radio was our second staged reading of
the season.No alcohol wasprovided at this event.
December31st: The New Year's Eve Ball Drop Drop In is an event
designed for the whole family to have a place to enjoy some New Year's
festivities, while waiting forthe ever popular Ball Drop tohappen, with
musical performances in the auditorium and activities for the kids in the
lobby.Malt beverages are served atthisevent.
